\pard\ltrpar\keep\keepn\sb360\sa80 Car Troubleshooting Expert System\par

\pard\ltrpar\sb180\sa180\cf0\b\f5\fs24 Description:\b0  This is a simple Python program that acts as an interactive car\f6\_\f5 troubleshooting expert system. It encodes expert knowledge as a set of \b if-then\b0  rules. The program asks you a series of yes/no questions about your car\f7\rquote\f5 s symptoms and then prints out a diagnosis or advice.\par

\pard\ltrpar\keep\keepn\sb160\sa80\cf1\f0\fs32 Running the Program\par

\pard{\pntext\f11\'B7\tab}{\*\pn\pnlvlblt\pnf11\pnindent360{\pntxtb\'B7}}\ltrpar\fi-360\li720\sb36\sa36\cf0\b\f5\fs24 Python version:\b0  You need Python\~3 installed (e.g. Python\~3.7 or later). (The Python 2 interpreter is outdated.) On most systems you can run the script with the \f8\fs22 python3\f5\fs24  command{\cf3{\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://docs.python.org/3/tutorial/interpreter.html#:~:text=The%20interpreter%20operates%20somewhat%20like,a%20script%20from%20that%20file"}}{\fldrslt{\ul\cf4\cf4\ul [2]}}}}\f5\fs24 .\par
{\pntext\f11\'B7\tab}\b Save the script:\b0  Save the provided Python code to a file (for example, \f8\fs22 car_troubleshooter.py\f5\fs24 ).\par
{\pntext\f11\'B7\tab}\b Run it:\b0  Open a terminal (or command prompt) and navigate to the folder containing the script. Then execute:\par

\pard\ltrpar\sa200\f8\fs22 python3 car_troubleshooter.py\par

\pard\ltrpar\sb180\sa180\f5\fs24 (On some systems you may use \f8\fs22 python\f5\fs24  instead of \f8\fs22 python3\f5\fs24 .) The Python interpreter will read and execute the script file{\cf3{\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://docs.python.org/3/tutorial/interpreter.html#:~:text=The%20interpreter%20operates%20somewhat%20like,a%20script%20from%20that%20file"}}{\fldrslt{\ul\cf4\cf4\ul [2]}}}}\f5\fs24 . Make sure you have execute permissions or the correct file extension.\par
No special libraries are required (it uses only standard Python). The program runs entirely in the console.\par

\pard\ltrpar\keep\keepn\sb160\sa80\cf1\f0\fs32 Input and Output (User Interaction)\par

\pard{\pntext\f11\'B7\tab}{\*\pn\pnlvlblt\pnf11\pnindent360{\pntxtb\'B7}}\ltrpar\fi-360\li720\sb36\sa36\cf0\b\f5\fs24 Questions:\b0  When you run the program, it will prompt you with questions about your car\f9\rquote\f5 s symptoms, one at a time. Each question is answered by typing \b\f8\fs22 yes\b0\f5\fs24  or \b\f8\fs22 no\b0\f5\fs24  (or simply \f8\fs22 y\f5\fs24 /\f8\fs22 n\f5\fs24 ) and pressing Enter.\par
{\pntext\f11\'B7\tab}\b Collecting answers:\b0  Each \f9\ldblquote\f5 yes\f9\rdblquote\f5 /\f9\ldblquote\f5 no\f9\rdblquote  \f5 answer is recorded as a fact for the system. For example, the program might ask \i\f9\ldblquote\f5 Is the engine cranking when you turn the key?\f9\rdblquote\i0  \f5 and expect \f8\fs22 yes\f5\fs24  or \f8\fs22 no\f5\fs24 .\par
{\pntext\f11\'B7\tab}\b Output:\b0  After all relevant questions have been asked (or once a rule fires), the system prints the diagnosis or advice. For example, it might output something like:\line\par

\pard{\pntext\f11\'B7\tab}{\*\pn\pnlvlblt\pnf11\pnindent360{\pntxtb\'B7}}\ltrpar\fi-360\li720\sa200\f8\fs22 Diagnosis: The battery may be dead.\line Recommendation: Try jump\f6\_\f8 starting the car or replacing the battery.\par

\pard{\pntext\f11\'B7\tab}{\*\pn\pnlvlblt\pnf11\pnindent360{\pntxtb\'B7}}\ltrpar\fi-360\li720\sb36\sa36\b\f5\fs24 User interface:\b0  The console interface is designed to be simple and user-friendly. As one overview notes, an expert system\f9\rquote\f5 s user interface \f9\ldblquote\f5 is designed to be intuitive and user-friendly,\f9\rdblquote  \f5 so that even non-experts can answer questions and receive advice{\cf3{\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.geeksforgeeks.org/artificial-intelligence/expert-systems/#:~:text=3,Between%20System%20and%20User"}}{\fldrslt{\ul\cf4\cf4\ul [3]}}}}\f5\fs24 . In our case, the interface is just text prompts and answers.\par

\pard\ltrpar\keep\keepn\sb160\sa80\cf1\f0\fs32 Algorithm (How the Expert System Works)\par

\pard\ltrpar\sb180\sa180\cf0\f5\fs24 The program implements a \b rule-based\b0  decision process. All the diagnostic knowledge is stored in the code as a set of rules (the \b knowledge base\b0 ) and the program logic acts as the \b inference engine\b0  that applies those rules{\cf3{\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://elshad-karimov.medium.com/building-a-simple-rule-based-expert-system-in-python-df606403472e#:~:text=An%20expert%20system%20emulates%20the,It%20has"}}{\fldrslt{\ul\cf4\cf4\ul [4]}}}}{\cf3\f5\fs24{\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://stackoverflow.com/questions/2026071/neural-network-expert-system#:~:text=These%20are%20quite%20incompatible%20topics"}}{\fldrslt{\ul\cf4\cf4\ul [5]}}}}\cf0\ulnone\f5\fs24 . In general:\par

\pard{\pntext\f11\'B7\tab}{\*\pn\pnlvlblt\pnf11\pnindent360{\pntxtb\'B7}}\ltrpar\fi-360\li720\sb36\sa36\b Knowledge Base:\b0  The knowledge base contains \i facts and rules\i0  about car problems{\cf3{\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://elshad-karimov.medium.com/building-a-simple-rule-based-expert-system-in-python-df606403472e#:~:text=An%20expert%20system%20emulates%20the,It%20has"}}{\fldrslt{\ul\cf4\cf4\ul [4]}}}}\f5\fs24 . Each rule is an IF-THEN statement. For example:\par

\pard{\pntext\f11\'B7\tab}{\*\pn\pnlvlblt\pnf11\pnindent360{\pntxtb\'B7}}\ltrpar\fi-360\li720\sa200\i IF\i0  the car won\f9\rquote\f5 t start \b AND\b0  the headlights are dim, \i THEN\i0  suggest the battery may be dead.\line These rules are implemented in the Python code (for instance, as \f8\fs22 if\f5\fs24 /\f8\fs22 elif\f5\fs24  statements or entries in a list of rule objects).\par
{\pntext\f11\'B7\tab}\b Inference Engine:\b0  The inference engine is the program logic that \b asks questions\b0  and \b matches rules{\cf3\b0{\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://elshad-karimov.medium.com/building-a-simple-rule-based-expert-system-in-python-df606403472e#:~:text=An%20expert%20system%20emulates%20the,It%20has"}}{\fldrslt{\ul\cf4\cf4\ul [4]}}}}{\cf3\b0\f5\fs24{\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://stackoverflow.com/questions/2026071/neural-network-expert-system#:~:text=These%20are%20quite%20incompatible%20topics"}}{\fldrslt{\ul\cf4\cf4\ul [5]}}}}\cf0\ulnone\b\f5\fs24 . As you answer the yes/no questions, each response becomes a known fact. The engine then checks the rules against these facts. A simplified flow is:\par
{\pntext\f11\'B7\tab}Ask and collect facts:\b0  The program asks a question, you answer yes/no, and it records that fact.\par

\pard{\pntext\f11\'B7\tab}{\*\pn\pnlvlblt\pnf11\pnindent360{\pntxtb\'B7}}\ltrpar\fi-360\li720\sb36\sa36\b Match rules:\b0  For each rule, check if all of its conditions match the collected answers.\par
{\pntext\f11\'B7\tab}\b Fire rule:\b0  If a rule\f9\rquote\f5 s conditions are all satisfied, that rule \f9\ldblquote\f5 fires\f9\rdblquote\f5 : the system uses the rule\f9\rquote\f5 s conclusion.\par
{\pntext\f11\'B7\tab}\b Output:\b0  The system prints the rule\f9\rquote\f5 s conclusion as the diagnosis or advice. The process may then stop or continue checking other rules.\par

\pard\ltrpar\sb180\sa180 This loop of gathering facts and firing matching rules is a standard expert-system cycle (often called \i forward chaining\i0 ){\cf3{\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.academia.edu/82497603/Laserjet_Printer_Troubleshooting_Expert_System#:~:text=the%20next%20facts%20and%20update,African%20Journal%20of%20Industrial"}}{\fldrslt{\ul\cf4\cf4\ul [6]}}}}{\cf3\f5\fs24{\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://stackoverflow.com/questions/2026071/neural-network-expert-system#:~:text=These%20are%20quite%20incompatible%20topics"}}{\fldrslt{\ul\cf4\cf4\ul [5]}}}}\cf0\ulnone\f5\fs24 . In effect, the program iterates through the rules (\f7\ldblquote\f5 left-hand side\f7\rdblquote  \f5 conditions) and when a match is found, executes the rule\f7\rquote\f5 s action (the \f7\ldblquote\f5 right-hand side\f7\rdblquote\f5 ){\cf3{\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.academia.edu/82497603/Laserjet_Printer_Troubleshooting_Expert_System#:~:text=the%20next%20facts%20and%20update,African%20Journal%20of%20Industrial"}}{\fldrslt{\ul\cf4\cf4\ul [6]}}}}\f5\fs24 .\par
In summary, the logic is purely symbolic: no probabilistic or machine-learning methods are used. It simply uses hard-coded if-then rules. As one source explains, an expert system is based on \f7\ldblquote\f5 a set of rules and an inferential engine,\f7\rdblquote  \f5 where the rules are exactly IF-THEN statements{\cf3{\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://stackoverflow.com/questions/2026071/neural-network-expert-system#:~:text=These%20are%20quite%20incompatible%20topics"}}{\fldrslt{\ul\cf4\cf4\ul [5]}}}}\f5\fs24 . The inference engine in our Python code applies these rules to your answers and produces the final advice.\par
\b References:\b0  The above design follows the classic expert-system model{\cf3{\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://elshad-karimov.medium.com/building-a-simple-rule-based-expert-system-in-python-df606403472e#:~:text=An%20expert%20system%20emulates%20the,It%20has"}}{\fldrslt{\ul\cf4\cf4\ul [4]}}}}{\cf3\f5\fs24{\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://stackoverflow.com/questions/2026071/neural-network-expert-system#:~:text=These%20are%20quite%20incompatible%20topics"}}{\fldrslt{\ul\cf4\cf4\ul [5]}}}}\cf0\ulnone\f5\fs24 . The Python tutorial also notes that the interpreter will execute a script file when invoked with its filename{\cf3{\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://docs.python.org/3/tutorial/interpreter.html#:~:text=The%20interpreter%20operates%20somewhat%20like,a%20script%20from%20that%20file"}}{\fldrslt{\ul\cf4\cf4\ul [2]}}}}\f5\fs24 . The user-interface guidance comes from general AI texts noting that an expert system\f7\rquote\f5 s UI should be simple and user-friendly{\cf3{\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.geeksforgeeks.org/artificial-intelligence/expert-systems/#:~:text=3,Between%20System%20and%20User"}}{\fldrslt{\ul\cf4\cf4\ul [3]}}}}\f5\fs24 . The inference algorithm mirrors the typical pattern: gather user inputs (facts), check rules, fire matched rules, and repeat until a conclusion is reached{\cf3{\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.academia.edu/82497603/Laserjet_Printer_Troubleshooting_Expert_System#:~:text=the%20next%20facts%20and%20update,African%20Journal%20of%20Industrial"}}{\fldrslt{\ul\cf4\cf4\ul [6]}}}}{\cf3\f5\fs24{\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://stackoverflow.com/questions/2026071/neural-network-expert-system#:~:text=These%20are%20quite%20incompatible%20topics"}}{\fldrslt{\ul\cf4\cf4\ul [5]}}}}\cf0\ulnone\f5\fs24 .\par

